Why: This review rechecked the exact false-positive contract that previously blocked Package 2.2.
What: I verified the protected-scope fix in source, reran the required pytest lanes, reproduced the prior failure shape with live probes, and checked that warning IDs, blocking semantics, payload shape, and facade behavior stayed stable.
How: Scan-first Scribe reads on the changed code/tests plus direct `analyze_scaffold_quality(...)` probes and the required command suite.
